    "/solve": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Validated library in → WeekPlanResult out. Thin orchestration of the\nexact pipeline the CLI runs: load → choose_menu (or explicit menu) →\nbuild_week → session_plan → purchase/cost. No solver logic lives here.",
